ce-objective-issuer-ambition = [color=pink]Personal Ambitions[/color]

ce-ambition-strong-diet-name = Strict Diet
ce-ambition-strong-diet-desc = Because !REASON!, I decided that from now on my food will only be !FOOD!.

ce-ambition-cookism-name = Food Conservatism
ce-ambition-cookism-desc = I only know how to cook !FOOD!, and this is clearly my calling. I will not cook any other food in the coming years.

ce-ambition-mania-name = Mania
ce-ambition-item-mania-desc = Because !REASON!, I've long dreamed of owning !ITEM!...
ce-ambition-abstract-mania-desc = I like !TOPIC! so much! I want as much of it in my life as possible.
ce-ambition-species-mania-desc = !SPECIES! - the best race in the world!

ce-ambition-job-gift-name = Charity Event
ce-ambition-job-gift-desc = I want to give !ITEM! to every !JOB!!

ce-ambition-become-rich-name = Making Money
ce-ambition-become-rich-desc = I plan to earn at least !COUNT! gold coins!

ce-ambition-location-love-name = Dreams of Home
ce-ambition-location-love-desc = !LOCATION! - the best place in the world. I want to live there.

ce-ambition-bard-soul-name = Bard's Soul
ce-ambition-bard-soul-desc = I dream of performing in public, playing songs and entertaining people.

ce-ambition-alcoholic-name = Alcoholic
ce-ambition-alcoholic-desc = Can't resist a drink. Need to have another glass.

ce-ambition-food-critic-name = Food Taster
ce-ambition-food-critic-desc = I am a famous food taster. I must evaluate every dish.

ce-ambition-word-of-honor-name = Word of Honor
ce-ambition-word-of-honor-desc = I promise myself to never lie!

ce-ambition-liar-name = Liar
ce-ambition-liar-desc = Can I never tell the truth?

ce-ambition-hoarder-name = Hoarder
ce-ambition-hoarder-desc = I need my own personal corner where I can store EVERYTHING. In general, any things can come in handy in the future, so I'll take them for myself.

ce-ambition-drama-master-name = Drama Master
ce-ambition-drama-master-desc = I want to attract as much attention as possible by simulating some kind of accident.

ce-ambition-befriend-name = Friendship
ce-ambition-befriend-desc = I want to become close friends with !NAME!.

ce-ambition-enemy-name = Hidden Grudge
ce-ambition-enemy-desc = !NAME! seriously wronged me in the past, and I don't even want to see him. Let him go to hell.

ce-ambition-date-name = Date
ce-ambition-date-desc = I want to arrange a date with !NAME!, where we will romantically eat !FOOD!...

ce-ambition-profession-change-name = Career Change
ce-ambition-profession-change-desc = I am not satisfied with who I am. I think if I become !JOB!, my life will be much better.

ce-ambition-manipulator-name = Manipulator
ce-ambition-manipulator-quarrel-desc = Can I make !NAME1! and !NAME2! quarrel?
ce-ambition-manipulator-friend-desc = Can I make !NAME1! and !NAME2! close friends?

ce-ambition-support-name = Support
ce-ambition-support-desc = Because !REASON!, I would like !NAME! to be okay.

ce-ambition-story-collector-name = Story Collector
ce-ambition-story-collector-desc = I am writing a book of memories. I need to learn the most interesting life story from !COUNT! people.

ce-ambition-secret-benefactor-name = Secret Benefactor
ce-ambition-secret-benefactor-desc = Today I will anonymously help !NAME!. They must not find out it's me.

ce-ambition-unusual-collector-name = Unusual Collector
ce-ambition-unusual-collector-desc = I collect rare things. Today I need to find !COUNT! pieces of !ITEM!.

ce-ambition-interior-designer-name = Interior Designer
ce-ambition-interior-designer-desc = !LOCATION! looks terrible. I must decorate it and make it cozy.

ce-ambition-peacemaker-name = Peacemaker
ce-ambition-peacemaker-desc = I cannot stand conflicts. If I see an argument, I will definitely try to reconcile the disputants.

ce-ambition-paranoidal-name = Paranoid
ce-ambition-paranoidal-desc = I am sure everyone around me is lying to me!

ce-ambition-innocent-soul-name = Naive Soul
ce-ambition-innocent-soul-desc = I take everything at face value! People can't be lying to me, can they?

ce-ambition-hoverboard-name = Passion for Flying
ce-ambition-hoverboard-desc = I so want to have my own personal hoverboard and ride it through the skies...

ce-ambition-hoverboard-race-name = Racer
ce-ambition-hoverboard-race-desc = I want to arrange a hoverboard race with !NAME!.

ce-ambition-safety-name = Safety Regulations
ce-ambition-safety-desc = I must ensure every citizen has an emergency levitation amulet. No one should die from falling off the island.

ce-ambition-suspicion-name = Suspicion
ce-ambition-suspicion-desc = I am sure !NAME! is a criminal, but I cannot prove it.

ce-ambition-harsh-commander-name = Harsh Commander
ce-ambition-harsh-commander-desc = My subordinates must obey me unquestioningly, or they will be fired.

ce-ambition-kind-commander-name = Kindest Guard Commander
ce-ambition-kind-commander-desc = Everyone deserves a second chance. My kind word can surely convince others not to repeat their mistakes.

ce-ambition-gluttony-name = Deadly Sin: Gluttony
ce-ambition-gluttony-desc = Delicious food is the best thing in this world. If I die, it should be from overeating.

ce-ambition-faked-death-name = Faked Death
ce-ambition-faked-death-desc = Everyone must believe that I died.

ce-ambition-extremist-name = Extremist
ce-ambition-extremist-desc = Thrills are the meaning of my life. Jumping off roofs into snowdrifts, walking along the edge of an abyss... It's just my lifestyle.

ce-ambition-thief-vengeance-name = It's Personal
ce-ambition-thief-vengeance-desc = Poor !NAME! crossed my path in the past - I won't stand for it. I will take away everything he holds dear. Leave him in nothing but his pants. Literally.

ce-ambition-thief-carcat-mischief-name = Cat Mischief
ce-ambition-thief-carcat-mischief-desc = I love watching things fall down. I need to throw as many other people's things off the island as possible.

ce-ambition-thief-lair-name = My Lair
ce-ambition-thief-lair-desc = Because !REASON!, I must set up my lair in !LOCATION!.

ce-ambition-thief-carrin-magpie-name = Magpie
ce-ambition-thief-carrin-magpie-desc = I really like shiny things. I want to collect a big collection of various shiny things.

ce-ambition-thief-blind-justice-name = Blind Justice
ce-ambition-thief-blind-justice-desc = I want the rich to become richer and the poor to become poorer.

ce-ambition-fashionista-name = Fashionista
ce-ambition-fashionista-desc = I want to be dressed according to the latest fashion.

ce-ambition-nesting-name = Nesting
ce-ambition-nesting-desc = I want to build a nest in some high place. And preferably not live there alone.
